<a class="back-link" href="/accounting">‹ Accounting</a>
<h1><%= focusInventoryCost?'Add the missing inventory cost':'Earlier balances' %></h1>
<p>Accounting is already working automatically. This is a one-time migration only, for balances from before you started using StockChief. It does not move stock or recreate past sales.</p>
<% if(latestOpeningId){ %><p><a href="/accounting/opening/<%= latestOpeningId %>">Continue your saved opening review</a></p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/accounting/setup/review" class="stack-form">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="currency" value="<%= configured.currency %>"><input type="hidden" name="costingMethod" value="<%= configured.costingMethod %>">
<label class="field">Opening date<input class="input" type="date" name="startDate" value="<%= configured.startDate||today %>" required></label>
<% if(!focusInventoryCost){ %><h2>Migration step 1 of 3 · Earlier money balances</h2><label class="field">Cash and bank accounts<input class="input" name="cash" inputmode="decimal" value="0"></label><label class="field">Customers owe you<input class="input" name="receivables" inputmode="decimal" value="0"></label><label class="field">You owe suppliers<input class="input" name="payables" inputmode="decimal" value="0"></label><% } %>
<h2 id="inventory-costs"><%= focusInventoryCost?'Inventory costs':'Migration step 2 of 3 · Inventory costs' %></h2><p>Enter the total purchase cost of the units you already own at each location. Stock quantities stay the same.</p>
<% if(!positions.length){ %><p>No stock positions need an opening value.</p><% }else{ %><div class="table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Product / variant</th><th>Location</th><th>Units</th><th>Total cost ($)</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const position of positions){ %><tr><td><%= position.item_name %><%= position.variant_label?' / '+position.variant_label:'' %><small><%= position.code %></small></td><td><%= position.location_name %></td><td><%= helpers.qty(position.on_hand) %></td><td><input type="hidden" name="skuId" value="<%= position.sku_id %>"><input type="hidden" name="locationId" value="<%= position.location_id %>"><input class="input" name="inventoryCost" value="<%= position.prefilledTotalCost %>" inputmode="decimal" aria-label="Total cost for <%= position.item_name %> at <%= position.location_name %>" required></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><% } %>
<% if(!focusInventoryCost){ %><h2>Migration step 3 of 3 · Review before posting</h2><% } %><label class="field">Source or explanation<input class="input" name="sourceDescription"></label><p>You will review the full balanced entry before approving it.</p><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit"><%= focusInventoryCost?'Review these inventory costs':'Review earlier balances' %></button>
</form>
